## Combat
- 3 hit combos
- Light or Heavy attack
- Up + Light sends player into aerial
- Up + Heavy sends enemy into air
- Heavy can launch into air
- Down + attack for impact moves
- Aerial attacking with light attacks in air
- Bullet size and impact effect